// is a fact of the world, set from the lie of the lake: LAKE_BEARING is the way from the bay to the crater's middle,
// out over the lake to the far rim (north-west). The old moon stands 13 degrees to the north of that, 23 degrees up:
// low over the far rim; in the moonless hour the light is the sky's own pale band low over that same rim, weaker;
